   "start": 0.5,
   "end": 9.035,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "A ship was found drifting across the Atlantic Ocean.",
     "start": 0.5,
     "end": 3.679
    },
    {
     "text": "Its cargo was still there.",
     "start": 3.829,
     "end": 5.343
    },
    {
     "text": "Food and water remained on board.",
     "start": 5.493,
     "end": 7.264
    },
    {
     "text": "But every person had vanished.",
     "start": 7.414,
     "end": 9.035
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c2",
   "start": 9.485,
   "end": 22.905,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "The ship was called the Mary Celeste.",
     "start": 9.485,
     "end": 11.363
    },
    {
     "text": "On November 7, 1872, it left New York for Genoa, Italy, carrying ten people, including the captain, his wife and their two-year-old daughter.",
     "start": 11.513,
     "end": 22.905
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c3",
   "start": 23.355,
   "end": 29.243,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Almost a month later, another ship spotted it near the Azores.",
     "start": 23.355,
     "end": 27.109
    },
    {
     "text": "Sailors approached and climbed aboard.",
     "start": 27.259,
     "end": 29.243
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c4",
   "start": 29.693,
   "end": 37.524,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "What they discovered was extraordinary.",
     "start": 29.693,
     "end": 31.784
    },
    {
     "text": "The ship was still seaworthy.",
     "start": 31.934,
     "end": 33.47
    },
    {
     "text": "Its cargo of industrial alcohol was largely intact.",
     "start": 33.62,
     "end": 37.524
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c5",
   "start": 37.974,
   "end": 42.583,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Personal belongings remained in the cabins.",
     "start": 37.974,
     "end": 40.321
    },
    {
     "text": "But there was nobody anywhere on board.",
     "start": 40.471,
     "end": 42.583
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c6",
   "start": 43.033,
   "end": 48.921,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Even the lifeboat was missing.",
     "start": 43.033,
     "end": 44.654
    },
    {
     "text": "The captain, his family and all seven crew members were never found.",
     "start": 44.804,
     "end": 48.921
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c7",
   "start": 49.371,
   "end": 62.044,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Investigators examined the mystery, but no explanation was ever proven.",
     "start": 49.371,
     "end": 54.129
    },
    {
     "text": "More than 150 years later, one question remains: why did ten people abandon a ship that was still floating?",
     "start": 54.279,
     "end": 62.044
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}